{
    "title": "Givebacks",
    "description": "The Givebacks app has been completely redesigned to make it easy for busy parents to support their kids' school in just a few taps. \r\n\r\nEffortlessly donate to local schools and causes\r\nMake one-time donations, manage recurring donations, and track your giving history.\r\n\r\nBuy items and memberships from the school storefront\r\nPurchase products from their store, memberships and more. Easily access digital PTA memberships right from the wallet.\r\n\r\nEarn online and in-store\r\nShop at thousands of participating stores and restaurants and earn donations for your favorite cause.\r\n\r\nManage everything in one place\r\nView your giving history and receipts, view memberships, update payment methods, and allocate automatic donations all from the wallet. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nOther audiences for reference.\r\n\r\nPTA - \r\nAll you need to easily help parents support your school\r\n\r\nOther NPOs - \r\nAll you need to build/grow/drive/unlock support for your cause\r\n\r\nSchool district - \r\nAll you need for unit oversight, compliance, and payments\r\n\r\n\r\nAlso note: The Givebacks app uses Android's Accessibility permission to know when you're on an eligible website (in your Chrome browser) where donations are available. Upon sign up, the app will walk you through how to enable the permission. You don't need to enable Accessibility to still use the Givebacks app, but enabling the permission will make shopping and earning donations much more convenient.",
    "descriptionHTML": "The Givebacks app has been completely redesigned to make it easy for busy parents to support their kids&#39; school in just a few taps. <br><br>Effortlessly donate to local schools and causes<br>Make one-time donations, manage recurring donations, and track your giving history.<br><br>Buy items and memberships from the school storefront<br>Purchase products from their store, memberships and more. Easily access digital PTA memberships right from the wallet.<br><br>Earn online and in-store<br>Shop at thousands of participating stores and restaurants and earn donations for your favorite cause.<br><br>Manage everything in one place<br>View your giving history and receipts, view memberships, update payment methods, and allocate automatic donations all from the wallet. <br><br><br><br>Other audiences for reference.<br><br>PTA - <br>All you need to easily help parents support your school<br><br>Other NPOs - <br>All you need to build/grow/drive/unlock support for your cause<br><br>School district - <br>All you need for unit oversight, compliance, and payments<br><br><br>Also note: The Givebacks app uses Android&#39;s Accessibility permission to know when you&#39;re on an eligible website (in your Chrome browser) where donations are available. Upon sign up, the app will walk you through how to enable the permission. You don&#39;t need to enable Accessibility to still use the Givebacks app, but enabling the permission will make shopping and earning donations much more convenient.",
